    turnFlow: "1. **Trump Call**: The Caller names the suit (Rung) based on their first 5 cards. 2. **The Lead**: Caller leads the first trick. 3. **The Trick**: Players must follow suit. Highest trump wins; if no trump, highest card of led suit wins. 4. **Accumulation Rule**: When a player wins a trick, they DO NOT collect the cards yet. The cards remain face down in the center heap. 5. **Double Sar Rule**: If the SAME player wins the *next* trick (two in a row), they capture the ENTIRE heap (all previous uncollected tricks) and place them in their team's pile. 6. **13th Trick**: The winner of the 13th (final) trick captures strictly that trick plus any uncollected heap remaining.",
